(@cwf_p4, 'Rectangular solid wood coffee table with a lower storage shelf and tapered legs.', 'This rectangular coffee table is built from solid sheesham wood with tapered legs and a lower open shelf for magazines or remotes. Joinery is reinforced with metal corner brackets for extra load-bearing strength during transit and use. A UV-cured lacquer finish resists scratches and sun fading. Popular for both retail furniture stores and hospitality projects ordering in bulk.');
