(@cwf_p13, 'Nesting set of 2 wooden side tables in graduated sizes that stack together.', 'This nesting set includes two solid wood side tables in graduated sizes designed to tuck one beneath the other when not in use. Legs are angled and reinforced at the joints for stability during shipping and daily handling. A protective lacquer coating guards against water rings and minor scuffs. Popular with retail furniture chains for space-saving living room displays.');
