(@cwf_p15, 'Enclosed 3-shelf wooden shoe rack cabinet with flip-down front doors.', 'This shoe rack cabinet has three internal shelves enclosed behind flip-down front panels, keeping footwear dust-free and out of sight. The carcass is built from moisture-resistant engineered wood with a solid wood top surface usable as a bench or display shelf. Hinges are rated for high-frequency daily use. Frequently stocked by home decor retailers for entryway and mudroom storage sections.');
