(@cwf_p24, 'Pair of tapered solid wood candle holder stands sized for pillar candles.', 'This pair of candle holder stands is turned from solid sheesham wood and sized to fit standard pillar candles securely. A heat-resistant metal insert is fitted into each holder cup to prevent scorching of the wood base. Stands are finished with a natural sealant that highlights the wood grain. Commonly bundled with tray sets for festive and wedding gifting catalogues sold in bulk.');
