(@cwf_p34, 'Set of 6 solid wood drink coasters with a matching storage stand.', 'This coaster set includes six solid sheesham wood coasters and a matching slotted wooden stand for compact storage between uses. Each coaster is sealed with a heat and moisture-resistant lacquer coat to protect table surfaces from drink condensation. Rounded edges give a smooth, splinter-free finish suitable for daily household or cafe use. A high-turnover bulk item for gifting hampers and home decor retailers.');
