(@bsi_p1, 'Ergonomic grip 0.7mm ball pens, low-viscosity ink, boxed in packs of 10.', 'Each pen uses low-viscosity oil-based ink for consistent, skip-free writing over long use. The barrel has a textured comfort grip and a reinforced stainless steel tip to resist wear. Suited for corporate stationery kits, school supply orders and retail resale. Supplied in boxes of 10; MOQ is 1 box per colour.');
